   The 'singularity-AI-bindings' module is the glue that makes PyTorch (and your MAMMOTH
   training) run inside the supported ROCm container with the right
   Slingshot/CXI networking and GPU libraries. Without it, things often
   “work” but are slow/fragile (TCP fallback, plugin not found, odd CXI
   warnings).

